     * @param string|null $mysqlver The minimum version of MySQL® that the system requires to restore the backed up
     *     database files. Null omits it.
     * @param bool|null $serializedOutput Whether to encode each line of the script's output in JSON format in order to
     *     allow the `live_tail_log.cgi` script to stream it. Null omits it.
     * @param bool|null $skipacctdb Whether to exclude the account's databases from the cpmove archive. Null omits it.
     * @param bool|null $skipapitokens Whether to exclude the account's API tokens from the archive. Null omits it.
     * @param bool|null $skipauthnlinks Whether to exclude the account's external authentication credentials from the
     *     archive. Null omits it.
     * @param bool|null $skipbwdata Whether to exclude the account's bandwidth data from the archive. Null omits it.
     * @param bool|null $skipdnssec Whether to exclude the account's DNSSEC configuration from the archive. Null omits
     *     it.
     * @param bool|null $skipdnszones Whether to exclude the account's DNS zone file information from the archive. Null
     *     omits it.
     * @param bool|null $skipftpusers Whether to exclude the account's FTP user accounts from the archive. Null omits
     *     it.
     * @param bool|null $skiphomedir Whether to skip the home directory's contents. Null omits it.
     * @param bool|null $skiplinkednodes Whether to exclude the account's cPanel & WHM linked server nodes configuration
     *     from the archive. Null omits it.
